findings.body:
An `assignment_source` positional-or-keyword parameter was added to the abstract `sync_status_outbound`, but:
- no caller passes it;
- the status-sync task and kick-off path are unchanged;
- concrete implementations (Jira, VSTS, etc.) don't declare it.

The base signature now suggests status sync cycles are handled when they are not. The parameter also sits in the 4th positional slot, which subclasses don't accept positionally. Either implement status-sync cycle breaking end to end or drop this signature change.
